# ═══ Draft knowledge entry — OHOS cargo libcurl 无 HTTP/2：sparse 索引必须 multiplexing=false 降级 HTTP/1.1 ═══
# Timestamp: 2026-10-08
# Software: alacritty/0.17.0（适配实测）；适用一切用 cargo + rsproxy.cn sparse
#   镜像拉依赖的 OHOS Rust 配方（argc/libsignal-core 家族的镜像方案增量）
# Gate: 本地 cargo fetch 实测（sparse 默认失败 → git 索引失败 → sparse+multiplexing=false 成功）
# Status: DRAFT — needs human/AI review to promote to E-entry

id:                     E3086
trigger_tool:           cargo|conan
phase:                  dependency-fetch
error_signature:        failed to enable HTTP/2, is curl not built right\?|
                        \[1\] Unsupported protocol|
                        failed to get `.*` as a dependency of package|
                        failed to query replaced source registry `crates-io`|
                        download of config\.json failed|
                        \[60\] SSL peer certificate or SSH remote key was not OK

severity:               2
category:               network, rust, cargo, http2, mirror
match_keywords:         cargo, HTTP/2, HTTP2, multiplexing, sparse, unsupported protocol,
                        curl not built right, config.json, crates-io, rsproxy,
                        git index, SSL peer certificate, registry, fetch failed

title:                  OHOS 侧 cargo 内置 libcurl 常缺 HTTP/2——sparse 注册表索引在默认多路复用下必失败，.cargo/config.toml 需 multiplexing=false + cainfo 双修

root_cause: >
  cargo 自带的网络栈是内置 libcurl。OHOS 设备/CI worker 上分发的 cargo
  （Harmonybrew bottle 或 rust-toolchain 包）其 libcurl 构建常未启用
  HTTP/2（设备 curl 同样：curl -v 显示 "using HTTP/1.x"）。而 cargo 的
  sparse 注册表协议默认启用 HTTP/2 多路复用（单连接并发多路请求）：
  cargo 在更新 sparse 索引时报 "failed to enable HTTP/2, is curl not
  built right? error: [1] Unsupported protocol"，随后 "download of
  config.json failed"，依赖解析完全无法进行。
  陷阱二段：换成 git 索引协议（rsproxy.cn/git/rsproxy-crates.io-index）
  躲开 HTTP/2，但 cargo 的 git 传输（libgit2）对 rsproxy 的证书链报
  "[60] SSL peer certificate or SSH remote key was not OK"（设备无默认
  CA bundle 且 git 传输的证书校验路径与 curl 不同），同样失败。

affected_scope:         一切在 OHOS 设备/CI 上以 rsproxy.cn sparse 镜像替换
                        crates-io 的 Rust 配方（argc/1.24.0、agent-browser、
                        libsignal-core 家族镜像方案的 HTTP/2 增量）；与包本身
                        无关，纯工具链网络栈能力问题。

rec_priority:           1
rec_approach:           cargo-config-multiplexing-false-http1
rec_description:        .cargo/config.toml [http] multiplexing=false 强制
                        HTTP/1.1 + cainfo 指向系统 CA 存储
rec_command:            printf '[http]\nmultiplexing = false\ncainfo = "/storage/Users/currentUser/usr/local/ssl/cert.pem"\n' >> .cargo/config.toml
rec_auto_fix:           true
rec_impl:               conan-recipe-cargo-http1-sparse-index
last_updated:               2026-10-19
authors:               unknown
doc_file:               doc/E3086.md
verification_cmd:       # 以 source_pr CI 门禁为准（PR n/a）
